Recorded benchmark inputs live here, one dataset per file.

The committed files are synthetic and seeded; real geometry can be added
alongside them with benchmarks/gh/export_fixture.py. Emptying the directory is
still a valid state -- the benchmark then runs on the in-code uniform generator
alone. Drop a file in and its cases appear automatically, no code change needed.

Naming: points_<name>.json or curves_<name>.json. The kind is in the filename
so the harness can list fixtures without parsing megabytes of JSON.

Format, the synthetic set's recipe, and the list of real datasets still worth
recording: ../../docs/benchmark-fixtures.md
